{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強制的にツーショットを携帯の待受にさせられ、れなりんに振り回される！笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも和田です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真だよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夕方、学校のことで、撮影が遅くなった居残り組の二人組のっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや＋れなりん＝まありん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の名古屋の握手会では同じレーンだったよんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにぃーさゆりんも同じだよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、長細いお菓子を鼻に入れる真似して写真を撮ってたなぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをななみんが撮ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オチャメなさゆりんだっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも昨日の握手会は楽しかったぁ！\n来てくれかたや、これないけど応援してくださってた皆様〜ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか色々勉強になったし、\n自分の不足部分や、\n選抜と自分との差も感じることもできた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実した一日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人の写真とったけど、違う携帯で撮って、それでこの自分の携帯だと容量大きくて入んなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の林間学校いってきたよー♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稲刈りしたりぃー、ご飯や掃除、\nみんなとドッチボールしたりっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これご飯"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの時間も充実してて楽しかったぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもークラスの友達ねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのこと......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒヨコ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒヨコ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呼んでくるのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、ニワトリ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って呼んであげたのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うへへ\nお友だち、先生、まつてくれてた皆様\nありがとう\nただいまあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もー！\n私はお姫様よっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！\n黙るよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の予定は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/23/5829463/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}